WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.048
Hi, friends!

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.791
Sit tall, feet flat on the floor.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.691
Today I brought… a surprise.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.196
Uh-oh. A big feeling showed up.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.781
Let’s be feeling detectives.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.617
Where is it in my body?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.424
Tight fists… hot cheeks…

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.818
Gently squeeze your hands.

00:00:38.618 --> 00:00:39.645
And let go.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.711
Every feeling has a name.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.038
Sad? Worried?

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.789
I think… it’s frustrated.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.635
Whoa! When we name a feeling, it gets a
little smaller.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.627
Your turn: whisper your feeling’s name into
your hands.

00:01:06.427 --> 00:01:08.520
Hands flat. Eyes closed.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.940
Smell the flower… 2, 3, 4.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.940
Blow out the cloud… 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.940
Smell the flower… 2, 3, 4.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.940
Blow out the cloud… 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.940
Smell the flower… 2, 3, 4.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.940
Blow out the cloud… 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.940
Smell the flower… 2, 3, 4.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.940
Blow out the cloud… 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.940
Smell the flower… 2, 3, 4.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.950
Blow out the cloud… 2, 3, 4, 5, 6.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.025
I named it. I tamed it.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.697
You can too!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.651
Hands back, eyes up, ready to learn.

